  "Software Details": "Szczegóły oprogramowania",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Z łatwością zarządzaj menu swojej restauracji za pomocą Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/Miesiąc",
  "/Year": "/Rok",
  "Buy Now": "Kup teraz",
  "View Live Demo": "Zobacz demonstrację na żywo",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Dynamiczne oferty i promocje",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Zwiększ swoją sprzedaż i przyciągnij więcej klientów dzięki naszej funkcji zarządzania ofertami. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Efektywne aranżacje stołów",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Zoptymalizuj swoją przestrzeń jadalną i usprawnij swoje operacje dzięki naszej funkcji aranżacji stołu. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Personalizacja i aktualizacje w czasie rzeczywistym",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Dostosuj swoje menu tak, aby pasowało do unikalnej tożsamości Twojej restauracji, korzystając z naszych narzędzi do tworzenia atrybutów i kategorii. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Lepsze zaangażowanie klientów",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Przenieś obsługę klienta na wyższy poziom dzięki naszym narzędziom do zarządzania klientami. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Aktualizacje frontendu w czasie rzeczywistym",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Dzięki Dash SaaS wszelkie zmiany wprowadzone w menu, ofertach lub aranżacji stołu są natychmiast widoczne w interfejsie. ",
